glass-tab-follower/-fence page tests (G4 leader/follower dissolves), lararium-browser tests/live/two-tab-walk.mjs.
design.md:41 ("floor followers hold no session") stands superseded by the 2026-11-06 ruling; true it.
# Then: SharedWorker entry (`vessel.shared-worker.ts`, `connect` → host.connect), page picks by capability, `?holder`
and shared-holder.worker.ts go, Pronaos route inventory (minimal named hunk), readiness waits on SW control (never the
